        "label": "Table 4.2"
      },
      "narration": "The pancreas makes three enzymes. Pancreatic amylase turns starch into maltose. Trypsin turns proteins into peptides. Lipase turns fats into fatty acids. In the small intestine, intestinal juice turns them into simple sugars and amino acids.",
